abstract: >
  This repository contains the implementation accompanying the manuscript
  "Simulated Variational Quantum Circuits for Hybrid Scientific Document
  Re-ranking". The study evaluates simulated Variational Quantum Circuits
  as second-stage document re-ranking models within a hybrid scientific
  document retrieval framework using the BEIR SciFact benchmark.